@testingcatalog: MICROSOFT 🔥: Autopilot is now expanding to work across Copilot, Teams, and Outlook for Microsoft 365 users. 

Microsoft is now entering an area of proactive AI agents that can draft replies, schedule meetings, and run routine tasks. 

Scoping this to Windows users - that's a big upgrade for the ecosystem and a push for further AI adoption in general. I think Microsoft is outrunning Google on this front, too.

@testingcatalog: MICROSOFT 🔥: Copilot got Workspaces, a new collaborative feature for teams and AI agents to work together. 

Workspaces have a shared context and were built on top of a former Projects feature. Users can invite others into their Workspaces and work on a common goal. 

